{"video_id":"jgy-013","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"concept_definition","statement":"本篇为金匮痰饮咳嗽病第十二；饮即水饮，运动出汗可排饮。","evidence_quote":"痰饮咳嗽病","start_s":5.54,"end_s":10.92,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"concept_definition","statement":"四饮：痰饮、悬饮、溢饮、支饮（讲中血饮/意义/知饮为音讹）。","evidence_quote":"痰饮","start_s":31.4,"end_s":34.36,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"感冒一剂即瘥者多无伏饮；屡发深重者内有饮，宜先排饮。","evidence_quote":"桂枝汤","start_s":138.28,"end_s":148.915,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"素盛今瘦、肠间沥沥有声谓之痰饮。","evidence_quote":"痰饮","start_s":229.78,"end_s":237.395,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"水流胁下、咳唾引痛为悬饮；勿畏用药。","evidence_quote":"悬疑","start_s":262.84,"end_s":274.325,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"水流四肢、当汗不汗、身体疼重为溢饮；轻证可用麻黄汤族。","evidence_quote":"意淫","start_s":274.82,"end_s":283.285,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"小青龙汤证可见两肩胛间背冷如掌大。","evidence_quote":"小青龙汤","start_s":637.55,"end_s":644.49,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0008","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"下利后心下仍坚满，示留饮未尽、水复回聚。","evidence_quote":"留饮","start_s":1969.982,"end_s":1976.642,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0009","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"杏仁与麻黄等量，称「秤不离砣」；青龙类不易出偏差。","evidence_quote":"麻黄","start_s":3118.546,"end_s":3124.031,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-013.kp0010","video_id":"jgy-013","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"葛根汤、麻黄汤等发表，毛窍一开则饮可随汗外排。","evidence_quote":"葛根汤","start_s":6128.322,"end_s":6130.602,"confidence":0.9}]}